{"title":"Edition 2, Chapter 6 — Streaming","checks":[{"id":"stream-deltas","title":"content streams as many deltas","points":20,"earned":0,"passed":false,"details":["saw 0 text deltas, want at least 8","a response delivered as one chunk reports exactly 1; that is the failure this check exists to catch","zero text deltas usually means the request never asked to stream, or the response content type was not checked"]},{"id":"deltas-match-final","title":"deltas reassemble into their finalized part","points":20,"earned":0,"passed":false,"details":["part 1 finalized with text but no delta ever carried part_id 1","the id on a delta must be the id on its final; if they are allocated separately they cannot correlate","text final part 3 has no matching delta group","text final part 1 has no matching delta group"]},{"id":"thinking-streamed","title":"reasoning streams under its own kind","points":15,"earned":0,"passed":false,"details":["saw 0 deltas of kind \"thinking\", want at least 2","the scripted response contains a reasoning block; reporting none means thinking deltas are dropped or labelled as text","labelling reasoning as text is worse than dropping it: it lands in the answer"]},{"id":"tool-params-streamed","title":"tool calls stream name and arguments","points":15,"earned":0,"passed":false,"details":["saw 0 deltas of kind \"tool_call\", want at least 3 (a name and several argument fragments)","the scripted response calls a tool; reporting no tool_call deltas means the arguments were never surfaced","tool_call final part 2 has no matching delta group"]},{"id":"delivery-not-content","title":"streaming changes delivery, not content","points":10,"earned":0,"passed":false,"details":["neither run produced an assistant line","stream request streaming flag disagrees with selected delivery","stream request streaming flag disagrees with selected delivery","unknown model must complete in plain mode: error= stream=false text-deltas=0","stream exercise dependency: core and consumer need distinct module declarations","compares observable finals and measured usage, unknown-model fallback and separate aggregate exercise; gated flush, SSE framing and complete opaque replay remain required source/integration proof"]},{"id":"ch5-parity","title":"All corrected Chapter 5 checks pass","points":20,"earned":20,"passed":true}],"score":20,"max_score":100,"passed":false}
